["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/AnnotationType/other", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Used to store extra information about an Element which is not part of a review (e.g. extra information provided during the creation of the Element).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
